*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Public assets — ignore everything by default. Only chart templates and
# assets referenced by index.html are tracked; raw market data (CSV/parquet)
# and local-only icons stay out of git. Negating a path inside a fully-
# excluded directory does not work, so we re-admit each parent directory
# before re-admitting its children.
public/*
!public/favicon.svg
!public/data/
public/data/*
!public/data/templates/
*.parquet
*.csv
out/
